{"id":"6058569a5f2311c9","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit.md","title":"电路混合的下一位预测","display":"lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit — 电路混合的下一位预测","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit","aliases":["28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit"],"display":"lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit — 电路混合的下一位预测","depends_on":["[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 20.10 and the averaging argument","source_printed_pages":"408–409","source_pdf_pages":"434–435","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit — 电路混合的下一位预测"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d42ba324c0358975\" href=\"?note=d42ba324c0358975\" title=\"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness\">28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 20.10 and the averaging argument"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"408–409"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"434–435"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{Dist}_m\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{Dist}_m\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adv}\">\\(\\operatorname{Adv}\\)</span> 与测试电路类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d42ba324c0358975\" href=\"?note=d42ba324c0358975\" title=\"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness\">28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{&lt;i}\">\\(R_{&lt;i}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i\">\\(R_i\\)</span> 为同一随机样本 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_m)\\leftarrow R\">\\(r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_m)\\leftarrow R\\)</span> 的前缀及第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 位投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_{&lt;1}\">\\(r_{&lt;1}\\)</span> 为空串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left[\\exists D\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\\;\\operatorname{Adv}_m(D,R)\\ge\\epsilon\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\left[\\exists i\\in[m]\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_{i-1}(s+3)\\;\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow R}[\\operatorname{out}_C(r_{&lt;i})_1=r_i]\\ge\\tfrac12+\\tfrac\\epsilon m\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left[\\exists D\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\\;\\operatorname{Adv}_m(D,R)\\ge\\epsilon\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\left[\\exists i\\in[m]\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_{i-1}(s+3)\\;\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow R}[\\operatorname{out}_C(r_{&lt;i})_1=r_i]\\ge\\tfrac12+\\tfrac\\epsilon m\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明保留显式门数余量。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_i\">\\(H_i\\)</span> 为前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 位来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>、后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m-i\">\\(m-i\\)</span> 位独立均匀的混合分布。取区分优势的符号后，望远镜求和给出一个有符号相邻接受概率差至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon/m\">\\(\\epsilon/m\\)</span>。固定该位置，并先均匀选择候选位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 与后缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(r_{&lt;i}bv)\">\\(D(r_{&lt;i}bv)\\)</span> 接受则预测 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>，否则预测 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-b\">\\(1-b\\)</span>；若相邻差的符号为负则交换预测。其成功概率恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span> 加上有符号相邻差。\n对独立的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,v\">\\(b,v\\)</span> 平均，存在固定值使成功率不降低。固定后预测器是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的限制或其补：至多增加两个共享常量节点及一个 NOT 节点，输入节点数从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 减为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i-1\">\\(i-1\\)</span>，故总节点预算至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+3\">\\(s+3\\)</span>。空前缀由零输入电路表示。\n这是 Theorem 20.10 背后的有限混合论证，采用保守的显式预算，不把原书未展开的电路版本误写成对均匀 PPT 定理的直接调用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness","status":"resolved","id":"d42ba324c0358975","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness","status":"resolved","id":"d42ba324c0358975","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$；$R\\in\\operatorname{Dist}_m$。\n$\\operatorname{Adv}$ 与测试电路类见 [[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]。$R_{<i}$、$R_i$ 为同一随机样本 $r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_m)\\leftarrow R$ 的前缀及第 $i$ 位投影；$r_{<1}$ 为空串。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{Dist}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adv}","display":false},{"tex":"R_{<i}","display":false},{"tex":"R_i","display":false},{"tex":"r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_m)\\leftarrow R","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"r_{<1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\left[\\exists D\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(s)\\;\\operatorname{Adv}_m(D,R)\\ge\\epsilon\\right]\\\\\n&\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\left[\\exists i\\in[m]\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_{i-1}(s+3)\\;\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow R}[\\operatorname{out}_C(r_{<i})_1=r_i]\\ge\\tfrac12+\\tfrac\\epsilon m\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"H_i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"m-i","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon/m","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"D(r_{<i}bv)","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"1-b","display":false},{"tex":"1/2","display":false},{"tex":"b,v","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"i-1","display":false},{"tex":"s+3","display":false}],"bytes":2372,"backlinks":[{"id":"0079cad93c58c949","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第20章：去随机化与NW构造：[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]、[[28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration]]、[[28-cor-log-seed-derandomization]]、[[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]、[[28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit]]、[[28-lem-nw-design-existence]]、[[28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-thm-hardness-derandomization]]。"}],"outgoing":["d42ba324c0358975"]}